{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Story That Twists Reality</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What seems familiar will soon turn into something terrifyingly different. Your choices shape multiple endings \u2014 but will you uncover the truth, or remain lost in the dark?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919480/extras/55cad60e2c361b1c22bde53f4d653cc2.poster.avif?t=1759337117\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919480/extras/55cad60e2c361b1c22bde53f4d653cc2.webm?t=1759337117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Second Coming You Never Saw Coming</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faith, sacrifice, and doubt collide in a short yet unforgettable horror experience. One evening is enough to finish it \u2014 but the story will haunt you long after. Step in. Feed. Repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919480/extras/2bdf75ccfcabb71560c76846aa4f43bd.poster.avif?t=1759337117\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919480/extras/2bdf75ccfcabb71560c76846aa4f43bd.webm?t=1759337117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919480/extras/2bdf75ccfcabb71560c76846aa4f43bd.mp4?t=1759337117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Descent into the Holy Hole</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Chosen, you must serve \u2014 feed, clean, perform the rituals \u2014 or be devoured along with all of humanity. A PSX-inspired nightmare 